From: Marius Bagassien <marius.b@variscite.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Mar 2026 10:33:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] variscite: bootanimation: Add Variscite logo assets

Add variscite-logo-mask.png and variscite-logo-shine.png to the
framework default assets so they are available to the boot animation
when the logo override soong config variables are set.

Signed-off-by: Marius Bagassien <marius.b@variscite.com>
